00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.940
There's a racial issue that's going on.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.760
And it's not a white and black thing.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:07.970
It's a, I would say Mexican,
but that's kind of offensive.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.610
I could say Latino, but then
that includes everybody.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.810
But it's generally with the group

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:15.120
who consider themselves Southsiders,

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:17.600
from Southern California, and the blacks.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.750
They got this stupid ass war going on

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.150
and it evolved from the prison.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:23.150
I thought it was limited to the prisons.

00:17:24.426 --> 00:17:29.426
I don't dislike people
races, I dislike a person.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:31.690
If you dislike me, I dislike you.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:36.050
There's this stupid ass
war going on in prison,

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.707
over something that's not yours.

00:17:37.707 --> 00:17:39.280
"Okay, these our work out bars,

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.970
that's your toilet, this is our benches."

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.740
And it's nobody's.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:45.170
But it's the cause of the separation.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:50.170
And now they're doing it
30s, 40s, on the West Side,

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.730
they're doing this same stupid thing.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:56.160
Mexicans or Latinos or whatever

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.620
you wanna refer to yourself as,

00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:59.790
are jumping on black
people indiscriminately,

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.010
men, women and children.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.750
And black people are jumping
on Mexicans indiscriminately,

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.590
men, women, and children.

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:09.710
One thing I know for
sure, being a black man,

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:12.320
we do not raise our children to hate.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.590
We raise them to defend they self,

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.750
to stand up for they self,

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:15.987
but we don't raise them,

00:18:15.987 --> 00:18:17.710
"Hey, you hate 'em
because they're Mexican.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.450
You hate 'em because they're Asian."

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:23.460
No, we don't do it, the other races do it.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:26.470
Especially the South side Mexicans

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:30.010
they're raising their
children just to hate us

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:30.860
because of color.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.550
Not because they know us,

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.840
not because they had an incident with us

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.950
just because they hate.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.960
So they're passing it on.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:43.530
And it took me about 20 years
in prison to realize this

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:44.807
but they're raising
their children that way.

00:18:44.807 --> 00:18:46.400
And I knew it was true

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.870
