segregation in the schools.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.280
Because when I went to
school, we weren't separated.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.220
We was whole, we was a whole unit.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.830
Football team, basketball
team, the whole school.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.567
Now it's divided just like the
prisons and everything else.

00:19:08.567 --> 00:19:10.987
"So united we stand, divided we fall."

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:13.860
And it's real, it's taking place.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:16.320
And I was surprised hear
about it a couple of weeks ago

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.650
because I didn't know
what was taking place

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.483
till it was brought to me.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:24.330
And I don't have the racial segregation.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:27.370
I don't have the racial discrimination

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.630
